k for more G C S E Chemistry explanations,

124
00:06:47,698 --> 00:06:50,647
worked examples and examination practice.

125
00:06:51,262 --> 00:06:54,583
Thank you for watching, and I look forward to seeing you in

126
00:06:54,641 --> 00:06:55,581
the next lesson.

